{% comment %} hero: page (kicker, headline, headline_day, visit_title), home (hero_photo, hero_photo_day), photos, site, t, events_next, events_soon, events_url, menu. Under the headline, in both themes, the event-promo that site.js picks for tonight or tomorrow (none without JavaScript). Full-height photo with the headline; always light on dark (on-photo). By day (coffee) it shows hero_photo_day, headline_day and the way here; by night (cocktails) hero_photo, headline and what's on. Only the photo on show is loaded. The last sentence of a headline becomes the neon sign. {% endcomment %}
<section class="hero on-photo">
  <div class="hero__photo">
    {%- if home.hero_photo_day %}
    <div class="hero__shot" data-theme-only="night">{% render 'components/photo', img: photos[home.hero_photo], alt: '', sizes: 'max(100vw, 138vh)' %}</div>
    <div class="hero__shot hero__shot--day" data-theme-only="day">{% render 'components/photo', img: photos[home.hero_photo_day], alt: '', sizes: 'max(100vw, 138vh)' %}</div>
    {%- else %}
    {% render 'components/photo', img: photos[home.hero_photo], alt: '', sizes: 'max(100vw, 138vh)', eager: true %}
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="wrap hero__body">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ page.kicker }}</p>
    {%- if page.headline_day %}
    <h1 class="hero__title" data-theme-only="night">{{ page.headline | neon_last | raw }}</h1>
    <h1 class="hero__title" data-theme-only="day">{{ page.headline_day | neon_last | raw }}</h1>
    {%- else %}
    <h1 class="hero__title">{{ page.headline | neon_last | raw }}</h1>
    {%- endif %}
    <p class="hero__status">{% render 'components/open-pill', t: t %}</p>
    {%- if events_soon.size > 0 %}
    <div class="hero__promo" data-promos hidden>
      {%- for e in events_soon %}
      {% render 'components/event-promo', e: e, t: t, events_url: events_url %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
    <p class="hero__actions" data-theme-only="night">
      {%- if events_next.size > 0 %}
      <a class="btn btn--neon" href="#events">{{ t.hero_whats_on }}</a>
      {%- else %}
      <a class="btn btn--neon" href="#visit">{{ page.visit_title }}</a>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if menu.size > 0 %}
      <a class="btn" href="#menu">{{ t.hero_drinks }}</a>
      {%- endif %}
    </p>
    <p class="hero__actions" data-theme-only="day">
      <a class="btn btn--neon" href="#visit">{{ page.visit_title }}</a>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ t.call }}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
